  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESOB Project (Water Resources in the SOcle of Burkina Faso)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate - IWRM</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RESOB project aims to initiate changes in the practices of actors involved in groundwater detection in Burkina Faso. The project is carried out by Georeva Afrique, in a consortium with IRD and 2iE.

The project has three main paths for change:

&#x2013; Axis 1: Revise the drilling implementation procedure.

&#x2013; Axis 2: Demonstrate the economic interest of changing practices.

&#x2013; Axis 3: Share knowledge by adopting an inclusive approach.

The ultimate goal of the project is to enable Burkinabe people better access to drinking water.</narrative>
  </description>
